## Original Content
The author opens up about her decision to publish 'Big Little Truths' and why she won't be working on the third season of the HBO series.

## Summary
Liane Moriarty wrote a sequel to 'Big Little Lies' titled 'Big Little Truths', deviating from her usual practice. She discusses her decision behind the sequel and confirms she won't be involved in the third season of the HBO adaptation.

## Key Points
- Liane Moriarty wrote 'Big Little Truths', a sequel to 'Big Little Lies'
- This move breaks her typical pattern of not writing sequels
- Moriarty will not be involved in the third season of the HBO series


